His hair is blonde and he had two braids that extended to just below his shoulders, already in the back of his hair and in the top part some strands were loose.  His eyes have lilac iris and in his left ear he wore a silver hoop earring;  another important detail is his skin color, which was and remains light and pink

 He is 17 years old and 1.80 m tall. He frequents several cabarets and is always in nightclubs.

 Haitani doesn't have many people close to him besides his younger brother, due to his fame, he has admirers among the delinquents in Japan, one of those admirers is Takashi Mitsuya, who thought he and Rindou were stylish when they were kids.  Ran's most relevant relationships are in the S-62 generation, as the boy met them in reformatory and followed with them when they formed Yokohama Tenjiku.  It is shown in the Tokyo Revengers character book that Ran admires and respects Kakuchou, on the other hand, he hates Hanma Shuji and Kisaki Tetta, who were his teammates in Tenjiku.  Hakkai Shiba is one of several delinquents who harbor a grudge against Ran, in Hakkai's case, he doesn't like the boy because of the time the Haitani brothers beat up Mitsuya while hunting Toman members in Tokyo.  Ran and Rindou's relationship is like that of any pair of brothers, as Ran tends to be more protective and uses his experience to try to guide Rindou as much as possible, despite this, he is a figure feared by his older brother. new

